2\" data-fail=\"0\"></section><p style=\"white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\"><br style=\"visibility: visible;\"></span></p><section style=\"display: flex; width: 100%; flex-flow: column; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"z-index: 2; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"text-align: center; justify-content: center; display: flex; flex-flow: row; margin: 10px 0px -32px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block; width: 95%; vertical-align: top; align-self: flex-start; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); padding: 0px; border-style: solid; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(240, 198, 128); box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"margin: 10px 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify; padding: 0px 20px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 为提升餐饮人在开店租房过程中的法律意识与权益保护能力，博望餐饮法务咨询团队于6月25日成功举办了主题为《租赁合同 - 开店租房的权益保护屏障》的法务课程。本次活动吸引了众多餐饮人士的积极参与，收获了良好的反馈与成效。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\"><br style=\"visibility: visible;\"></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 本次课程主讲人为北京盈科（沈阳）律师事务所合伙人、博望餐饮法务咨询团队合伙人</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">党俏律师</span></strong><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">与博望团队资深律师</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">王曼思律师</span></strong><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">。两位律师在租赁法务领域深耕多年，拥有丰富的实践经验，为在场餐饮人带来了一场内容丰富、实用性强的精彩课程。主持人为博望团队</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">李哲律师</span></strong><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align: right; transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px); box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block; width: 41px; height: 40px; vertical-align: top; overflow: hidden; background-color: rgb(176, 37, 35); box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1 1\" style=\"float: left; line-height: 0; width: 0px; vertical-align: top; visibility: visible;\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"插图\"></svg></section></section><p style=\"white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\"><br style=\"visibility: visible;\"></span></p><section style=\"display: flex; width: 100%; flex-flow: column; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"z-index: 2; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"text-align: center; justify-content: center; display: flex; flex-flow: row; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: bottom; width: 45%; align-self: flex-end; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; margin: 0px 10px 0px 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"justify-content: center; display: flex; flex-flow: row; margin: 0px 0px 10px; width: 100%; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(240, 198, 128); align-self: flex-start; padding: 5px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: 0; width: 100%; box-sizi